==Event Information==
The Magical Girls of "{{Color|#FF0000|'''Puella Magi Madoka Magica the Movie Part 1: Beginnings", "Puella Magi Madoka Magica the Movie Part 2: Eternal", and "Puella Magi Madoka Magica The Movie -Rebellion- "'''}} return to The Battle Cats for another spectacular Collab Event!<br>
{{Color|#E500FF|'''On between Nov. 8th (11:00am) and Nov. 22nd, 2021 (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Limited "Puella Magi Madoka Magica" Collab Capsules!'''}}<br>
For a short time only, select the Puella Magi Madoka Magica set at the Rare Capsule menu to recruit awesome magical girl heroes into your Cat Army!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Collab-only Units available in this set include:'''}}<br>
[[Madoka Kaname (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Madoka Kaname (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
A long-range specialist delivering powerful anti-Floating attacks with 100% chance of Slow!<br>
[[Homura Akemi (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#800080|'''Homura Akemi (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks have a chance to Freeze Black enemies!<br>
[[Mami Tomoe (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Mami Tomoe (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Can only attack enemies at a distance, but has superior range and delivers massive damage vs Angels!<br>
[[Sayaka Miki (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#00BAFF|'''Sayaka Miki (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Her area attacks gain power as she takes damage, and she survives one lethal attack!<br>
[[Kyoko Sakura (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Kyoko Sakura (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks have a chance to knockback and weaken Red enemies!<br>
[[Kyubey (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#34A853|'''Kyubey (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Tough vs Aliens, with a chance to survive lethal attacks!<br>
[[Bebe (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#800080|'''Bebe (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks with 100% chance to weaken Aliens and Zombies!<br>
Level it up to reveal its evolution into {{Color|#800080|'''Nagisa and Cat!'''}}<br>

'''{{Color|#FF00FF|[[Madoka Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|Madoka Cat}}]], [[Sayaka Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|Sayaka Cat}}]], [[Mami Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|Mami Cat}}]], [[Kyoko Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|Kyoko Cat}}]], [[Homura Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|Homura Cat}}]] (Rare)}}'''<br>
Battle Cat reimaginings of your favorite magical girls!<br>
Don't miss out!

※ During the crossover campaign period, you will have a set chance to collect one of the "Puella Magi Madoka Magica" collab units from the "Puella Magi Madoka Magica" capsule set. "Puella Magi Madoka Magica" units can not be collected from other Rare Capsule sets. Please make sure that you have selected the "Puella Magi Madoka Magica" capsule set by tapping the icon at the top of the Rare Capsule Machine page.<br>
※If "Puella Magi Madoka Magica" Collab Capsules fail to appear in the Rare Capsule Machine, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version.

{{Color|#FF0000|'''● Collab Maps in The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
Challenge specials stages to destroy the witches' labyrinths! "Puella Magi Madoka Magica" characters appear as enemies! Visit the Legend Stories to take on these limited edition event maps!<br>
・Collab Map {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''"Be A Magical Girl"'''}}<br>
Get a chance to collect {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Li'l Madoka'''}} each time you clear one of the event stages. And remember, your chances are better when you play more difficult stages in the map!<br>
(Or get a {{Color|#FF0000|'''100%'''}} guarantee of picking up stage rewards by using the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Treasure Radar item'''}}!)

{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Collab Map "Be A Magical Girl II"'''}}<br>
Get a chance to collect {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Kyubey Cat'''}} each time you clear one of these event stages. And remember, your chances are better when you play more difficult stages in the series!<br>
(Or get a {{Color|#FF0000|'''100%'''}} guarantee of picking up stage rewards by using the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Treasure Radar item'''}}!)
After unlocking Kyubey Cat, remember to activate him by visiting the Rare Cat section of the Upgrade menu!

・Collab Map {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''"Witch's Labyrinth"'''}}<br>
Enjoy collab-only stages with Puella Magi Madoka Magica The Movie -Rebellion- backgrounds and themes on the '''The Rose Garden Witch, The Dessert Witch,''' and '''The Box Witch''' stages!<br>
During this crossover event, stages featuring terrifying Witch enemies will appear on a blitz schedule at the times below. You won't know which Witch will be attacking until you enter the map!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''6:00am～8:59am / 12:00pm～2:59pm / 7:00pm～10:59pm'''}}<br>
Defeat the Witches to gain {{Color|#0000FF|'''huge XP rewards'''}}!

・Collab Map {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''"Walpurgisnacht"'''}}<br>
Clear these Gauntlet stages for a chance to unlock {{Color|#E500FF|'''Li'l Madoka's'''}} True Form!<br>
The "Walpurgisnacht" map will appear starting {{Color|#FF0000|'''Day 3 of the collab (Nov. 11th at 11:00am)!'''}}<br>
Can you clear all 10 Tough stages in this the cycle of deadly strife?!

・Collab Map {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''"Nutcracker Witch"'''}}<br>
Can you defeat the half-finished Witch?<br>
Clear this stage for a chance to unlock {{Color|#E500FF|'''Li'l Homura's'''}} True Form and earn a {{Color|#FF6D01|'''Rare Ticket'''}} reward!<br>
"The Nutcracker Witch" map will appear starting {{Color|#FF0000|'''Day 6 of the collab (Nov. 14th at 11:00am)!'''}} Can you defeat this Deadly challenge?!

※ Li'l Madoka will be available to collect from the Become A Magical Girl stage, Kyubey Cat will be available to collect from Become A Magical Girl II, and Li'l Homura will be available to collect as a free campaign reward when visiting the Cat Base any time between Day 6 of the Collab (Nov. 13th 12:00am) and Nov. 22nd (11:59pm).<br>
※ You can activate Li'l Madoka and Kyubey Cat at the Rare Cats section, and Li'l Homura at the Special Cats section of the Upgrade Menu!<br>
※ Li'l Madoka / Li'l Homura may be upgraded to their True Forms after reaching Level 20.<br>
※ If the relevant stages are cleared before the character is collected, it is possible that you may unlock the True Form before the actual Cat Unit.<br>
※ If collab stages do not appear at the listed times, make sure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version.<br>
Plus, get a {{Color|#FF00FF|'''first-time clear reward of 30 Cat Food'''}} when you achieve victory on all stages on any of these maps!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Special collab missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Take on Special Mission challenges and earn cool bonus rewards by playing limited-time-only Puella Magi Madoka Magica events!

※Puella Magi Madoka MagicaSpecial Missions will only appear in the Catnip Challenges until Nov. 22nd, 2021 at 11am. You must accept all rewards before the mission disappears at the end of the Catnip Challenges event!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Login each day for another login stamp!'''}}<br>
Awesome login bonuses, available to collect only during this collab event!<br>
Visit The Battle Cats each day during this collab campaign to pick up every stamp and unlock a Rare Ticket or useful battle items.

※ Up to 14 Stamps can be collected during this event.

